1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:03,776
Careful: the maths is the same in both sexes.

2
00:00:03,776 --> 00:00:07,304
Two meiotic divisions, four haploid nuclei.

3
00:00:07,304 --> 00:00:09,817
The difference is the cytoplasm.

4
00:00:09,817 --> 00:00:16,106
In the female nearly all of it goes into one cell, so the egg can feed the early embryo.

